    <section id="home-1" class="home-1" style="background-image: url(https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/DYERSBURG-CUTS-IMAGE-5-01.jpg)" >
    <div class="home-1__top xl-con">
      <div class="home-1__left">
              <div class="double-heading-content-con dbl-heading left-aligned">
        <h2 class="double-heading bottom-line both-caps">Welcome to <br /><span>Dyersburg State</span></h2>        <div class="content">
          <p>Dyersburg State Community College focuses on student learning and offers high-quality academic programs that allow you to complete your first two years of college coursework at about one-half the cost of attending a public four-year institution.</p>
<p>Dyersburg State also offers career programs that provide the skills you need to enter the job market or upgrade your current skills. In addition, the College offers several certificate programs that prepare students for specific, high-demand occupations.</p>
        </div>
      </div><!-- end double-heading-content-con -->
                      <div class="home-1__buttons">
                          
            <div class="theme-button align-left">
                <a class="cta theme-outline-1 round" href="https://www.dscc.edu/how-to-apply-for-admission/" target="_self">Apply Now</a>
            </div>
                                  
            <div class="theme-button align-left">
                <a class="cta theme-outline-1 round" href="https://apply.dscc.edu/register/?id=eaea8c6c-754c-4ae7-b3dd-e6a332e9b213" target="_blank">Request Info</a>
            </div>
                                  
            <div class="theme-button align-left">
                <a class="cta theme-outline-2 round" href="https://www.dscc.edu/make-an-appointment/" target="_self">Make An Appointment</a>
            </div>
                              </div><!-- end home-1__buttons -->
              </div><!-- end home-1__left -->
              <div class="home-1__right">
                      <div class="school-fact">
              <picture><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_2512-scaled-e1787690070159-938x1024.jpeg"><source media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_2512-scaled-e1787690070159-768x838.jpeg"><img class="picture-img" src="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_2512-scaled-e1787690070159.jpeg" alt="A student stands outdoors on a campus walkway holding a notebook, binder, and drink. The student is wearing a sleeveless white polka-dot top, light blue jeans, and white sandals, with a shoulder bag. Behind the student is a large grassy lawn, mature trees, and a campus building visible in the distance. The photo was taken on a sunny day with clear blue skies and natural lighting." >
</picture>              <div class="school-fact__inner">
                <p><span>Fact</span><br /> From student clubs and organizations to sports, academic and cultural events, students have lots of options to get involved!</p>
              </div>
            </div><!-- end school-fact -->
                      <div class="school-fact">
              <picture><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WJC08830-1-scaled-e1787690260104-776x1024.jpg"><source media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WJC08830-1-scaled-e1787690260104-768x1014.jpg"><img class="picture-img" src="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WJC08830-1-scaled-e1787690260104.jpg" alt="Two students smiling and posing in a well-lit hallway." >
</picture>              <div class="school-fact__inner">
                <p><span>Fact</span><br /> DSCC offers 63 degree concentrations and 23 certificates.</p>
              </div>
            </div><!-- end school-fact -->
                      <div class="school-fact">
              <picture><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/DSCC-Stock-Photos-65-scaled-e1787689963178-1024x821.jpg"><source media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/DSCC-Stock-Photos-65-scaled-e1787689963178-768x615.jpg"><img class="picture-img" src="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/DSCC-Stock-Photos-65-scaled-e1787689963178.jpg" alt="" >
</picture>              <div class="school-fact__inner">
                <p><span>Fact</span><br /> Dyersburg State Community College sports include Men&#039;s Baseball, Men&#039;s &amp; Women’s Basketball, Men&#039;s &amp; Women&#039;s Cross Country and Half-Marathon, Men&#039;s &amp; Women&#039;s Golf, Men&#039;s &amp; Women’s Soccer, Women&#039;s Softball, and Women&#039;s Volleyball!</p>
              </div>
            </div><!-- end school-fact -->
                  </div><!-- end home-1__right -->
          </div><!-- end home-1__top -->
          <div class="home-1__bottom xl-con">
        
            <div class="theme-button align-center">
                <a class="cta special-button" href="https://www.dscc.edu/schedule-a-visit/" target="_blank">Schedule a Tour</a>
            </div>
              </div><!-- end home-1__bottom -->
      </section><!-- end home-1 -->
  <section class="home-2">
    <div class="home-2__top xl-con">
            <div class="double-heading-content-con dbl-heading left-aligned">
        <h2 class="double-heading bottom-line both-caps">Academic <br /><span>Programs</span></h2>        <div class="content">
          <p>Dyersburg State Community College focuses on student learning and offers high-quality academic programs that allow you to complete your first two years of college coursework at about one-half the cost of attending a public four-year institution.</p>
        </div>
      </div><!-- end double-heading-content-con -->
        </div><!-- end home-2__top -->
    <div class="home-2__bottom xl-con">
              <div class="home-2__programs">
                      <div class="program">
              <picture><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/DSCC-Stock-Photos-46-1024x683.jpg"><source media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/DSCC-Stock-Photos-46-768x512.jpg"><img class="picture-img" src="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/DSCC-Stock-Photos-46-scaled.jpg" alt="" >
</picture>              <div class="program__inner">
                <h3>Healthcare</h3>
                <div class="program__content">
                  <p>Healthcare Programs at Dyersburg State provides quality education in the field of healthcare and prepares students to meet the demands of the health care industry. </p>
                  
            <div class="theme-button align-center">
                <a class="cta theme-outline-1 round" href="https://catalog.dscc.edu/content.php?catoid=43&#038;navoid=2636" target="_self">Learn More</a>
            </div>
                        </div><!-- end program content -->
              </div><!-- end program__inner -->
            </div><!-- end program -->
                      <div class="program">
              <picture><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/DSCC-Stock-Photos-107-1024x683.jpg"><source media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/DSCC-Stock-Photos-107-768x512.jpg"><img class="picture-img" src="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/DSCC-Stock-Photos-107-scaled.jpg" alt="" >
</picture>              <div class="program__inner">
                <h3>STEM</h3>
                <div class="program__content">
                  <p>STEM Programs at Dyersburg State helps develop skills to prepare students for tomorrow’s jobs in Science, Technology, Engineering and Mathematics.</p>
                  
            <div class="theme-button align-center">
                <a class="cta theme-outline-1 round" href="https://catalog.dscc.edu/content.php?catoid=43&#038;navoid=2636" target="_self">Learn More</a>
            </div>
                        </div><!-- end program content -->
              </div><!-- end program__inner -->
            </div><!-- end program -->
                      <div class="program">
              <picture><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/DSC_9795-1024x683.png"><source media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/DSC_9795-768x512.png"><img class="picture-img" src="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/DSC_9795.png" alt="" >
</picture>              <div class="program__inner">
                <h3>Transfer Programs</h3>
                <div class="program__content">
                  <p>With Dyersburg State’s Transfer program, students can begin college studies at DSCC, earn an associate degree, and transfer to a bachelor’s degree program at any public university and many private universities in Tennessee.</p>
                  
            <div class="theme-button align-center">
                <a class="cta theme-outline-1 round" href="https://catalog.dscc.edu/content.php?catoid=43&#038;navoid=2655" target="_self">Learn More</a>
            </div>
                        </div><!-- end program content -->
              </div><!-- end program__inner -->
            </div><!-- end program -->
                      <div class="program">
              <picture><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/DSCC-Stock-Photos-100-1024x683.jpg"><source media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/DSCC-Stock-Photos-100-768x512.jpg"><img class="picture-img" src="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/DSCC-Stock-Photos-100-scaled.jpg" alt="" >
</picture>              <div class="program__inner">
                <h3>Careers in a Year</h3>
                <div class="program__content">
                  <p>In 12 months or less, students can begin a rewarding and profitable career in fields such as business, computer technology, education, healthcare, industrial maintenance, law enforcement, medical coding and more!</p>
                  
            <div class="theme-button align-center">
                <a class="cta theme-outline-1 round" href="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/PUB-09_23_065-Career-In-A-Year-Booklet.pdf" target="_self">Learn More</a>
            </div>
                        </div><!-- end program content -->
              </div><!-- end program__inner -->
            </div><!-- end program -->
                      <div class="program">
              <picture><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_1401-e1699298732612-1024x813.jpg"><source media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_1401-e1699298732612-768x610.jpg"><img class="picture-img" src="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_1401-e1699298732612.jpg" alt="" >
</picture>              <div class="program__inner">
                <h3>Distance Education</h3>
                <div class="program__content">
                  <p>Dyersburg State offers online options to fit busy schedules. Students can pursue college credentials from the comfort of home, without giving up important responsibilities.</p>
                  
            <div class="theme-button align-center">
                <a class="cta theme-outline-1 round" href="https://www.dscc.edu/online/" target="_self">Learn More</a>
            </div>
                        </div><!-- end program content -->
              </div><!-- end program__inner -->
            </div><!-- end program -->
                      <div class="program">
              <picture><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/DYERSBURG-CUTS-IMAGE-12-01-1024x731.jpg"><source media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/DYERSBURG-CUTS-IMAGE-12-01-768x548.jpg"><img class="picture-img" src="https://www.dscc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/DYERSBURG-CUTS-IMAGE-12-01.jpg" alt="" >
</picture>              <div class="program__inner">
                <h3>Business</h3>
                <div class="program__content">
                  <p>Business Programs at Dyersburg State are a great choice for students interested in pursuing a career in marketing, management, human resources or other business-related fields.</p>
                  
            <div class="theme-button align-center">
                <a class="cta theme-outline-1 round" href="https://catalog.dscc.edu/content.php?catoid=43&#038;navoid=2636" target="_self">Learn More</a>
            </div>
                        </div><!-- end program content -->
              </div><!-- end program__inner -->
